# api — request examples for the VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
@api = http://localhost:3000
@jwt = eyJ...
@apiKey = msh_...
@serviceToken = change-me-local-only-service-token

### Register (first user becomes admin)
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "super-secret-1" }

### Login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "me@example.com", "password": "super-secret-1" }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Create an API key (shown once)
POST {{api}}/auth/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "my key" }

### List my API keys
GET {{api}}/auth/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Shorten
POST {{api}}/urls
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/URL_shortening", "customSlug": "wiki" }

### My URLs
GET {{api}}/urls?limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Update destination
PUT {{api}}/urls/wiki
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/moved" }

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/urls/wiki
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Admin: dashboard
GET {{api}}/admin/dashboard
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Admin: users / user detail
GET {{api}}/admin/users
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Admin: search URLs
GET {{api}}/admin/urls?q=wiki
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Admin: health of all services
GET {{api}}/admin/health/services
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Internal: resolve slug (what redirect calls)
GET {{api}}/internal/urls/wiki
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

### Internal: click batch (what redirect sends)
POST {{api}}/internal/clicks
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "events": [ { "slug": "wiki", "ts": "2026-10-28T12:00:00Z", "referrer": null, "userAgent": "curl", "ipHash": null } ] }

### Ops
GET {{api}}/health
###
GET {{api}}/ready
###
GET {{api}}/metrics
